# Reverse percents (Phase 7)

// find the base: undo a percent
20 is 10% of what
# expect: 200

// off and on undo a discount or a markup through the
// relative-percent rules
180 is 10% off what
# expect: 200
220 is 10% on what
# expect: 200
41 is 17% on what
# expect: 35.0427350427

// find the percent: the fraction (a percent is its fraction)
30 is what percent of 200
# expect: 0.15
20 is what % of 200
# expect: 0.1

// answers compose like any value
answer * 200
# expect: 20

// the value side may be any expression
2 * 20 is 10% of what
# expect: 400

// words match case-insensitively
20 IS 10% OF WHAT
# expect: 200

// a near-miss keeps the old behavior (the honest error surfaces
// from the first unknown name now that the line parses)
20 is 10% of somewhere
# err: unknown name
